\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\lang9 A00298173\par
JDBC Assignment\par
\par
This JDBC project showcases the Liverpool team, consisting of tables and databases. Made to be from the perspective from Arne Slot the manager. He will need this database for managing player details and game statistics for his team to accurately organize this team into the most optimal one in the league.\par
This application can be used to store, update and analyze player details and their performance statistics effectively.\par
Features:\par
\ul CRUD Operations\par
\ulnone -Add\par
-Updates\par
-Delete\par
- View Player Detatils\par
- View Player Statistics\par
\ul\par
\ulnone Uses a relational database (players and statistics) \par
Exports data with positions and statistics. \par
\par
Information:\par
Consists of two tables:\par
Player Details: Name, position, age, nationality, contract duration, etc,\par
Game Statistics: Appearances, goals, assists, yellow cards, and red cards.\par
\par
Unique player positions.\par
Total players grouped by position.\par

